bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Reply Section (UI)" as UI
boundary Router
control ReplyController
control ReplyService
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Click Reply Upvote
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. POST /upvote (reply)
activate Router

Router -> ReplyController: 3. upVote(reply_id, req)
activate ReplyController

ReplyController -> ReplyController: 4. Check token / role
activate ReplyController
space
deactivate ReplyController

opt Token / Role Invalid
    ReplyController --> Router: 4.1 401 / 403 Error
    Router --> UI: 4.2 Show error
    UI --> User: 4.3 Error message
end

ReplyController -> ReplyService: 5. upVote(reply_id, payload)
activate ReplyService

ReplyService -> ReplyService: 6. Check legit user
activate ReplyService
space
deactivate ReplyService

alt User not valid
    ReplyService --> ReplyController: 6.1.1 Error
    ReplyController --> Router: 6.1.2 Error response
    Router --> UI: 6.1.3 Show error
    UI --> User: 6.1.4 Error message
else User is banned
    ReplyService --> ReplyController: 6.2.1 Error
    ReplyController --> Router: 6.2.2 Error response
    Router --> UI: 6.2.3 Show error
    UI --> User: 6.2.4 Error message
end

ref over User, MongoDB: 3.48.b.i. Subsequence - Vote reply 1